## Prompt 7 — Silent empty states in the UI

```
This component renders a finding block only when the finding text is truthy, and there
is no else branch anywhere in the codebase. Every upstream failure mode therefore
renders as absence, which is indistinguishable to the user from "nothing was wrong."

Add explicit empty states:
1. When status indicates a failure but no finding text exists, render an "undetermined"
   card showing the reason, styled as a warning rather than an error.
2. When the analysis step itself failed, render a distinct "analysis unavailable" state
   with a retry affordance.
3. When a result is marked low-confidence, render it with a visible confidence indicator
   rather than presenting it as definitive.

Show the updated component.
```

